      "path": "paicoding-service/src/main/java/com/github/paicoding/forum/service/rank/service/impl/UserActivityRankServiceImpl.java",
      "text": "List<SimpleUserInfoDTO> users = userService.batchQuerySimpleUserInfo(userScoreMap.keySet());\n\n        // 3. 根据评分进行排序\n        List<RankItemDTO> rank = users.stream()\n                .map(user -> new RankItemDTO().setUser(user).setScore(userScoreMap.getOrDefault(user.getUserId(), 0)))\n                .sorted((o1, o2) -> Integer.compare(o2.getScore(), o1.getScore()))\n                .collect(Collectors.toList());\n\n        // 4. 补齐每个用户的排名\n        // 上面只是设置了每个用户的id和评分，但是RankItemDTO里的rank(Integer)并为设置\n        IntStream.range(0, rank.size()).forEach(i -> rank.get(i).setRank(i + 1));\n        return rank;"
